(version 1)
# ADR 0006 decision 12: the CAN FD link nets (net class LINK in the .kicad_pro: CANH / CANL, LINK_GND, AUX_12V,
# the termination) keep 0.5 mm to every bus net (functional isolation <= 60 V on the outer layers; inner layers
# alike). Between link nets the class / board default applies (jumper and 0402 pads).
(rule "link to bus"
	(condition "A.NetClass == 'LINK' && B.NetClass != 'LINK' && B.Type != 'Footprint'")
	(constraint clearance (min 0.5mm)))
